               <id root="57454d58-7fb2-6736-e063-6394a90abea4"/>
               <code code="55105-1" codeSystem="2.16.840.1.113883.6.1" displayName="OTC - PURPOSE SECTION"/>
               <title>Purpose</title>
               <text>
                  <paragraph>Skin Protectant</paragraph>
               </text>
               <effectiveTime value="20260723"/>
            </section>
         </component>
         <component>
            <section ID="id_link_57454d58-7fb5-6736-e063-6394a90abea4">
               <id root="57454d58-7fb4-6736-e063-6394a90abea4"/>
               <code code="34067-9" codeSystem="2.16.840.1.113883.6.1" displayName="INDICATIONS &amp; USAGE SECTION"/>
               <title>Use</title>
               <text>
                  <paragraph>Helps soothe, moisturize, and protect dry, irritated skin</paragraph>
               </text>
               <effectiveTime value="20260723"/>
            </section>
         </component>
         <component>
            <section ID="id_link_57529b1c-81d5-66bf-e063-6394a90aaf4a">
               <id root="57529b1c-81d4-66bf-e063-6394a90aaf4a"/>
               <code code="34071-1" codeSystem="2.16.840.1.113883.6.1" displayName="WARNINGS SECTION"/>
               <title>Warnings</title>
               <text>
                  <paragraph>For external use only.</paragraph>
               </text>
               <effectiveTime value="20260724"/>
            </section>
         </component>
         <component>
            <section ID="id_link_57529c6c-fbc0-6858-e063-6394a90a79e1">
               <id root="57529c6c-fbbf-6858-e063-6394a90a79e1"/>
               <code code="50570-1" codeSystem="2.16.840.1.113883.6.1" displayName="OTC - DO NOT USE SECTION"/>
               <title>Do not use</title>
               <text>
                  <paragraph>Do not apply to broken, irritated, wounded, or inflamed skin.</paragraph>
               </text>
               <effectiveTime value="20260724"/>
            </section>
         </component>
         <component>
            <section ID="id_link_57529dde-0ecc-9045-e063-6294a90aa5c1">
               <id root="57529dde-0ecb-9045-e063-6294a90aa5c1"/>
               <code code="50567-7" codeSystem="2.16.840.1.113883.6.1" displayName="OTC - WHEN USING SECTION"/>
               <title>When Using </title>
               <text>
                  <paragraph>avoid contact with eyes, mouth, and other mucous membranes. In case of accidental contact, rinse thoroughly with clean water.</paragraph>
               </text>
               <effectiveTime value="20260724"/>
            </section>
         </component>
         <component>
            <section ID="id_link_5752afa2-abac-76ab-e063-6394a90adfe2">
               <id root="5752afa2-abab-76ab-e063-6394a90adfe2"/>
               <code code="50566-9" codeSystem="2.16.840.1.113883.6.1" displayName="OTC - STOP USE SECTION"/>
               <title>Stop Use </title>
               <text>
                  <paragraph>if skin redness, itching, rash, swelling, or other signs of irritation develop and persist.</paragraph>
               </text>
               <effectiveTime value="20260724"/>
            </section>
         </component>
         <component>
            <section ID="id_link_5752b30c-b014-777a-e063-6394a90a09a6">
               <id root="5752b30c-b013-777a-e063-6394a90a09a6"/>
               <code code="50569-3" codeSystem="2.16.840.1.113883.6.1" displayName="OTC - ASK DOCTOR SECTION"/>
               <title>Ask Doctor</title>
               <text>
                  <paragraph>if skin redness, itching, rash, swelling, or other signs of irritation develop and persist.</paragraph>
               </text>
               <effectiveTime value="20260724"/>
            </section>
         </component>
         <component>
            <section ID="id_link_5752b51f-4ff8-a69e-e063-6294a90a64e3">
               <id root="5752b51f-4ff7-a69e-e063-6294a90a64e3"/>
               <code code="50565-1" codeSystem="2.16.840.1.113883.6.1" displayName="OTC - KEEP OUT OF REACH OF CHILDREN SECTION"/>
               <title>Keep Out Of Reach Of Children</title>
               <text>
                  <paragraph>Keep out of reach of children and pets to prevent accidental ingestion or choking hazard.If swallowed, get medical help or contact a Poison Control Center right away.</paragraph>
               </text>
               <effectiveTime value="20260724"/>
            </section>
         </component>
         <component>
            <section ID="id_link_5752bc29-e2a1-7c4b-e063-6394a90a7784">
               <id root="5752bc29-e2a0-7c4b-e063-6394a90a7784"/>
               <code code="34068-7" codeSystem="2.16.840.1.113883.6.1" displayName="DOSAGE &amp; ADMINISTRATION SECTION"/>
               <title>Directions</title>
               <text>
                  <paragraph>•Clean and thoroughly dry the skin on the leg area where the patch will be applied.
  <br/>
•Cut the patch to your desired size if needed, then peel off the protective backing layer.
  <br/>
•Apply the adhesive side firmly to the target leg area and press evenly along all edges to ensure full skin contact.
  <br/>
•Leave the patch on for 2 to 4 hours per application, then remove and replace with a new patch.
  <br/>
•For optimal soothing and moisturizing results, use continuously as directed.
 </paragraph>
               </text>
               <effectiveTime value="20260724"/>
            </section>
         </component>
         <component>
            <section ID="id_link_5752be0b-c04d-bb4a-e063-6294a90a9e2e">
               <id root="5752be0b-c04c-bb4a-e063-6294a90a9e2e"/>
               <code code="44425-7" codeSystem="2.16.840.1.113883.6.1" displayName="STORAGE AND HANDLING SECTION"/>
               <title>Other information</title>
               <text>
                  <paragraph>Store in a cool, dry place at room temperature. Keep away from direct sunlight, high heat, and moisture. Keep sealed when not in use.</paragraph>
               </text>
               <effectiveTime value="20260724"/>
            </section>
         </component>
